<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Algorithmic Details</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For completeness, we provide pseudocode for the two phases of <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Clue</span>: the one-time centroid aggregation (Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.1 Algorithmic Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>) and the inference-time verification (Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ A.1 Algorithmic Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>). Both phases operate on <em id="A1.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">activation-delta matrices</em> (§<a href="#S3.SS2" title="3.2 Clue: Verification via Activation-Delta Summaries ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a>) and use the <em id="A1.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">layer-averaged Euclidean distance</em> in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E3" title="In 3.3 Centroid Construction and Classification ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>). The underlying LLM remains frozen throughout.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.1 Algorithmic Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> constructs the reference centroids from a labeled set of trajectories. We first partition the dataset by ground-truth labels. For each trajectory, we extract the hidden-state matrices at the boundaries of the explicit reasoning block (<span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;think&gt;</span> and <span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;/think&gt;</span>) and compute the activation delta <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{L\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{L\times D}</annotation></semantics></math> via Eq. (<a href="#S3.E1" title="In 3.2 Clue: Verification via Activation-Delta Summaries ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>). We then compute the element-wise mean within each class to obtain the success and failure <em id="A1.SS1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">centroid matrices</em> <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}}</annotation></semantics></math> (Eq. (<a href="#S3.E2" title="In 3.3 Centroid Construction and Classification ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>)), which serve as geometric references during inference.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Constructing <span id="alg1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Clue</span> Centroids (Learning Phase)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            Labeled dataset <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}=\{(T_{i},y_{i})\}_{i=1}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}=\{(T_{i},y_{i})\}_{i=1}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
            Initialize empty lists <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{\text{succ}},\,\mathcal{H}_{\text{fail}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{\text{succ}},\,\mathcal{H}_{\text{fail}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
            Define index sets <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}_{\text{succ}}=\{\,i\mid y_{i}=1\,\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}_{\text{succ}}=\{\,i\mid y_{i}=1\,\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}_{\text{fail}}=\{\,i\mid y_{i}=0\,\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}_{\text{fail}}=\{\,i\mid y_{i}=0\,\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{I}_{\text{succ}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{I}_{\text{succ}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
              Extract <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}_{\text{start},i}\in\mathbb{R}^{L\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mrow><mtext>start</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}_{\text{start},i}\in\mathbb{R}^{L\times D}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}_{\text{end},i}\in\mathbb{R}^{L\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mrow><mtext>end</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}_{\text{end},i}\in\mathbb{R}^{L\times D}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
              Compute <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}\leftarrow\mathbf{h}_{\text{end},i}-\mathbf{h}_{\text{start},i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mrow><mtext>end</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mrow><mtext>start</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}\leftarrow\mathbf{h}_{\text{end},i}-\mathbf{h}_{\text{start},i}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;">(Eq. <a href="#S3.E1" title="In 3.2 Clue: Verification via Activation-Delta Summaries ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
              Append <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{\text{succ}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{\text{succ}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{I}_{\text{fail}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{I}_{\text{fail}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
              Extract <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}_{\text{start},i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mrow><mtext>start</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}_{\text{start},i}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}_{\text{end},i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mrow><mtext>end</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}_{\text{end},i}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
              Compute <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}\leftarrow\mathbf{h}_{\text{end},i}-\mathbf{h}_{\text{start},i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mrow><mtext>end</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mrow><mtext>start</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}\leftarrow\mathbf{h}_{\text{end},i}-\mathbf{h}_{\text{start},i}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
              Append <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{h}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{\text{fail}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{\text{fail}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}}\leftarrow\text{mean}(\mathcal{H}_{\text{succ}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}}\leftarrow\text{mean}(\mathcal{H}_{\text{succ}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l14.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;">(Eq. <a href="#S3.E2" title="In 3.3 Centroid Construction and Classification ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}}\leftarrow\text{mean}(\mathcal{H}_{\text{fail}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>mean</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}}\leftarrow\text{mean}(\mathcal{H}_{\text{fail}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;">(Eq. <a href="#S3.E2" title="In 3.3 Centroid Construction and Classification ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}},\,\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}},\,\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ A.1 Algorithmic Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> describes the inference procedure. Given a new trajectory <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we compute its activation delta <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{h}_{\text{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{h}_{\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math> as in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E1" title="In 3.2 Clue: Verification via Activation-Delta Summaries ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>), measure its distances to the two centroid matrices using Eq. (<a href="#S3.E3" title="In 3.3 Centroid Construction and Classification ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>), and decide by nearest centroid.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Verification with <span id="alg2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Clue</span> (Inference Phase)</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            New trajectory <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math>; centroids <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}},\,\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}},\,\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
            Extract <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}_{\text{start,new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mtext>start,new</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}_{\text{start,new}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg2.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{h}_{\text{end,new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mtext>end,new</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{h}_{\text{end,new}}</annotation></semantics></math> from <math id="alg2.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
            Compute <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{h}_{\text{new}}\leftarrow\mathbf{h}_{\text{end,new}}-\mathbf{h}_{\text{start,new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mtext>end,new</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mtext>start,new</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{h}_{\text{new}}\leftarrow\mathbf{h}_{\text{end,new}}-\mathbf{h}_{\text{start,new}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l3.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;">(Eq. <a href="#S3.E1" title="In 3.2 Clue: Verification via Activation-Delta Summaries ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\text{succ}}\leftarrow d(\Delta\mathbf{h}_{\text{new}},\,\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\text{succ}}\leftarrow d(\Delta\mathbf{h}_{\text{new}},\,\mathbf{V}_{\text{succ}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l4.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;">(Eq. <a href="#S3.E3" title="In 3.3 Centroid Construction and Classification ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\text{fail}}\leftarrow d(\Delta\mathbf{h}_{\text{new}},\,\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐡</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\text{fail}}\leftarrow d(\Delta\mathbf{h}_{\text{new}},\,\mathbf{V}_{\text{fail}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l5.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;">(Eq. <a href="#S3.E3" title="In 3.3 Centroid Construction and Classification ‣ 3 The Clue Framework ‣ Clue: Non-parametric Verification from Experience via Hidden-State Clustering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\text{succ}}&lt;d_{\text{fail}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>fail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\text{succ}}&lt;d_{\text{fail}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l7.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> classified as correct
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l9.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> classified as incorrect
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
